+## OpenStorm .181 translation argument callable identity
+
+Locale and replacement-placeholder completion now shares the key-navigation
+callable identity proof. Imported global helper aliases keep their canonical
+parameter roles; namespaced local functions, foreign function imports and
+unrelated classes named Lang cannot receive Laravel argument suggestions.
+Existing positional/named binding and full-token UTF-16 edits remain unchanged.
+Contributed by @thinkycz.
+
 ## OpenStorm .172 selected builder middleware alias priority
 
 Literal alias maps in the selected standard builder's final Middleware callback
